; Zone aspmx.l.google.com (TEST-ONLY, step 2.3): stand-in for the Google Workspace MX hosts.
; aspmx.l and alt2-alt4 resolve to sink-google, alt1 to sink-google-alt (the failover target).
$ORIGIN aspmx.l.google.com.
$TTL 60
@       IN SOA  ns.sink.test. hostmaster.sink.test. ( 2026110301 3600 600 86400 60 )
@       IN NS   ns.sink.test.
@       IN A    172.31.250.27
alt1    IN A    172.31.250.28
alt2    IN A    172.31.250.27
alt3    IN A    172.31.250.27
alt4    IN A    172.31.250.27
